    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 54 Clearstream Court to the Dublin 11 property market. This superb apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a spacious and well-located home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming and spacious entrance hallway, leading into an exceptionally large open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, providing an ideal space for both relaxing and entertaining. The property further benefits from a generously sized bedroom, a well-appointed bathroom, a useful storage closet, and a convenient utility room/pantry located just off the kitchen.\r\n\r\nClearstream Court is a well-maintained gated development, offering residents privacy and security. The apartment is ideally positioned within the development and benefits from excellent transport links, with a bus stop located directly outside. The M50 and M1 motorways are also easily accessible, while Dublin Airport is just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently located close to a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities, with Charlestown Shopping Centre, Clearwater Shopping Centre, IKEA and Finglas Village all within easy reach. Dublin City University is also nearby, making the property an attractive option for both owner-occupiers and investors.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** While we have diligently ensured the accuracy of this information, some details may have been provided by the vendor. We do not assume responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies, and we advise all viewers to seek their own professional advice."
